## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.1 Codex
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s GPT-5.1 Codex is an agentic coding model positioned between Codex Mini and Codex Max for repo-scale software engineering (per local metadata), exposed via Responses API in Codex surfaces.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Codex/Responses API contexts. Local metadata lists `opencode/gpt-5.1-codex`, 400K/128K context, pricing $1.25/$10.00 (native) and Zen listing $1.07/$8.50, API shutdown 2026-07-23, `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Codex changelog era (2025) per local metadata references. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.1-codex`, `GPT-5.1 Codex`.
- **Context window:** 400,000 tokens total; 128,000 max output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10, historical):** OpenAI native $1.25/$10.00 per 1M ($0.125 cached); OpenCode Zen listed $1.07/$8.50 (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI coding model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

